  "articleBody": "A successful shower niche installation starts with a measured opening, compatible framing and waterproof backer materials, a location away from concentrated spray, and a bottom shelf that drains toward the shower. The niche must be integrated with the same waterproofing system used on the surrounding walls, then tiled without blocking drainage or leaving unsealed changes of plane.",
